# pro_item.msg — ADDITIONS ONLY
#
# This file contains ONLY the new message entries added by this mod.
# Do NOT place this file directly in data/text/english/game/ — the game
# will use it instead of the original, breaking all other item descriptions.
#
# Instead, open the original data/text/english/game/pro_item.msg from your
# Fallout 2 installation and APPEND the entries below to the end of that
# file.  Then place the merged file in your mod's data directory.
#
# Message-ID formula used by the Fallout 2 engine:
#   Item name        = PID + 100    →  600 + 100 = 700
#   Item description = PID + 1000   →  600 + 1000 = 1600
#
# If the wrong messages appear in-game, compare the IDs below against the
# formula your game version uses (e.g., some builds use PID + 1100 for
# descriptions).
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Dynamite MKII  (proto ID 600)
{700}{}{Dynamite MKII}
{1600}{}{A military-grade demolition charge packing twice the explosive force of standard dynamite. The casing is reinforced and the blasting compound has been enhanced for maximum yield. Handle with extreme care — the blast radius is significant.}
